  "authored_route_expectation_at_most_seven_steps": [
    "Produce gamma_n probability, actual C2-derived continuity/differentiability and compact support of f/partials, boundedness and L1 of f²/Phi(f²)/D_i²/fullsum; zero support and signed values retained.",
    "Handle n0 via pi_of_empty singleton Dirac and empty sum; for n+1 obtain true pi product law with measurePreserving_piFinSuccAbove and match Fin.consEquivL coordinates measurably.",
    "Apply actual binary39 to bounded nonnegative F(x,y)=f(Fin.cons x y)²; derive both genuine conditional-entropy subtraction identities and all joint/outer/slice L1 before algebra.",
    "Produce C2 and proper compact support of original scalar/tail slices by continuous affine insertion and true closed embedding; derive scalar/tail coordinate derivatives by chain rule. Never assume RMS marginal C2.",
    "Apply actual scalar38 and induction hypothesis to original slices; graph must retain both distinct consumers and positive coefficient2, not infer higher-dimensional inequality as a premise.",
    "Produce real L1 before integrating slice inequalities and using Fubini/split law; true finite integral_sum and head/tail direction identification assemble sum of coordinate squares, never operator-norm square.",
    "Return compact finite-product background only. Keep external SLT W12 route as alternative requiring explicit import/domain/conditional-entropy closure adapters; leave Hilbert transport/noncompact cutoff/T2/FIRST4.6 independent."
  ],
  "OR_truth_contract": "Printed primary only invokes GaussianLSI+T2. External SLT unbounded conditional-coordinate entropy/tower plus scalar-W12 energy is one background route; bounded binary39/scalar38 original-slice dimension induction is authored alternative. Explicit OR vertices/hyperedges must not conflate routes or make irrelevant external W12/cross-log prerequisites mandatory on the authored compact branch.",
  "hidden_regularity_and_failure_boundaries": [
    "Closed embeddings, not continuity alone, are needed to pull compact support to every fixed scalar/tail slice; actual support bound internally derived.",
    "Actual measurable split law and actual L1 before integral map/sub/order/Fubini. Totalized Bochner integral identities are not domain producers.",
    "Phi=tlogt continuous at zero; no f>0, normalized f² or positive mass binder. n0 and f0 stay included.",
    "D_i is evaluation at Pi.single i1; default Pi sup operator norm cannot replace finite coordinate-square sum. Full-sum L1 is an output.",
    "External W12 statement has genuine input Sobolev/differentiability/continuous partial/PhiL1 assumptions, authored compact target derives all from C2compact; do not pretend full W12 port.",
    "Future finite-Hilbert/stdGaussian law/chain/Parseval and noncompact actual32 cutoff require real proofs; canonical RN AE equality does not provide pointwise smooth derivative.",
    "Current39 shared/exposition closure historical timing preserved. Actual-parent admission is separate from source-only topology; no future40 body/proof/statement assumption mutation."
  ],
